ng> occasionally seeks your creations for darker motives. Whether you choose to serve them or stay loyal to your partners will shape your legacy. <br> <br><strong>Craft with purpose. Trade with precision. Build your robotic future on Xylaris-9.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Design, craft, and trade robots on the frozen world of Xylaris-9. Serve factions, upgrade your facility, and shape your robotic legacy in Robodeal Simulator.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Polish, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Turkish, Swedish, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Hungarian, Russian, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088760/a72c3e4aae4c0a7be732e422285482a978e25306/header.jpg?t=1785157450", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088760/63e0c49ddc5583fc9e9dd933aa183f4385a8a304/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785157450", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088760/63e0c49ddc5583fc9e9dd933aa183f4385a8a304/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785157450", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 3550<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX960<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></u